WEBVTT

00:00:07.505 --> 00:00:08.219
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:09.216 --> 00:00:11.657
<v><b>F:</b></v> Her husband is always in a hurry.

00:00:14.696 --> 00:00:15.390
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:16.419 --> 00:00:18.311
<v><b>M:</b></v> My headphones are at home.

00:00:21.403 --> 00:00:22.123
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:23.145 --> 00:00:25.240
<v><b>F:</b></v> His mother is in the hospital.

00:00:28.337 --> 00:00:29.117
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:30.099 --> 00:00:31.802
<v><b>M:</b></v> Lunch is half an hour.

00:00:34.671 --> 00:00:35.491
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:36.577 --> 00:00:38.659
<v><b>F:</b></v> Helen is a hair stylist.

00:00:41.678 --> 00:00:42.551
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:43.584 --> 00:00:46.090
<v><b>M:</b></v> The children are healthy and happy.